{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847090/extras/eb6f14bda2e8f3ad7d4f9a7236643e0e.poster.avif?t=1753657937\" width=1080 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847090/extras/eb6f14bda2e8f3ad7d4f9a7236643e0e.webm?t=1753657937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847090/extras/eb6f14bda2e8f3ad7d4f9a7236643e0e.mp4?t=1753657937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hollow Floor is an atmospheric psychological horror  set in a looping, scorched apartment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a scorched apartment, you attempt to escape the unending hallways. However, you quickly discover there is no escape, and you aren't the only one trapped here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration:</strong>\u00a0Explore the shifting apartment and become immersed in the horrors that await.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with others</strong>: You aren't the only one trapped here, perhaps others will lend you a hand, or drag you deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro graphics:</strong> Low-Poly Pixelated graphics evoke the feelings of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense sound design:</strong> Atmospheric soundscapes keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal psychological horror:</strong> Dreamlike unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time:</strong>\u00a0The game is intended to be played in one sitting and takes roughly 20-30 minutes. There is no saving.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847090?t=1753657937",